# Initial Data Analysis — Tips Dataset

## Project Description
This project performs an initial analysis of a restaurant tips dataset using Python and Pandas.

## Environment
Google Colab was chosen because it provides a ready-to-use Python environment without requiring local installation.

## Project Structure
```text
initial-data-analysis/
├── data/
│   └── tips.csv
├── notebooks/
│   └── 01_initial_analysis.ipynb
└── README.md
```

## Dataset
The dataset contains information about restaurant bills, tips, customers, days, and meal times.

## Analysis
- Dataset dimensions
- Column data types
- Missing values
- Basic descriptive statistics
- Histogram of total bills
- Bar chart of visits by day
- Three observations about the data

## Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Google Colab

## How to Run
1. Open the notebook in Google Colab.
2. Run the cells from top to bottom.
3. The dataset is loaded from a public URL.

